<section class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white py-24 md:py-36" data-header-theme="light" id="faq"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[90rem] px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10 grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1.5 shrink-0 bg-brand"></span>Questions</p><h2 class="reveal mt-6 font-heading text-5xl uppercase leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-7xl">F.A.Q</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Quick answers to the questions we hear most. For anything else, our team is only a call away.</p><div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-secondary p-6 md:p-8"><p class="font-heading text-base uppercase tracking-[-0.01em]">Can't find your answer?</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Send us a note with your shipment details and the right specialist will get back to you.</p><a class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-full font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-ink text-white hover:bg-brand focus-visible:outline-ink h-10 px-5 text-[11px] mt-6" href="mailto:hello@modulify.ai">Email us<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6"><ul class="border-t"><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-0" aria-expanded="true" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-0" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">01</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">What does Meridian Freight do?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 border-ink bg-ink text-white"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-45" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[1fr]" id="faq-answer-0" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">We are a freight forwarder and logistics provider. Our team handles air and ocean freight, customs brokerage, warehousing and 3PL, project cargo and domestic transport, either as single services or as one managed supply chain.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-1" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-1" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">02</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">What industries do you specialise in?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-1" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Our clients range from retail and consumer brands to technology suppliers and industrial projects. If your cargo needs specialist handling, tell us what you are moving and we will plan around it.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-2" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-2" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">03</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">What shipping methods do you offer?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-2" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Air freight, full and shared container ocean freight, and road transport across metro, regional and interstate routes, plus specialist handling for out-of-gauge and heavy lift cargo.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-3" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-3" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">04</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">Do you provide customs clearance services?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-3" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Yes. Our licensed customs brokers manage import and export clearance in-house, including tariff classification, duty and biosecurity requirements.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-4" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-4" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">05</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">How is freight pricing calculated?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-4" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-4" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Rates depend on the size and weight of your shipment, the origin and destination, the transport mode and current market conditions. Every quote itemises the charges so you can see exactly what you are paying for.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-5" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-5" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">06</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">Do you offer warehousing and 3PL services?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-5" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-5" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Yes. We provide storage, pick and pack, inventory management and distribution, linked directly to your inbound freight.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-6" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-6" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">07</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">Can you handle oversized or heavy cargo?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-6" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-6" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Yes. Project cargo is one of our specialties, including out-of-gauge and heavy lift shipments that need permits, route surveys and engineered loading.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b"><h3><button aria-controls="faq-answer-7" aria-expanded="false" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left md:py-7" id="faq-question-7" type="button"><span class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">08</span><span class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug md:text-xl">How do I request a quote?</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-ink"><svg class="lucide lucide-plus size-4 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-7" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]" id="faq-answer-7" inert="" role="region"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-7 pl-10 pr-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:pl-11 md:pr-14">Send us your shipment details through the enquiry form, by email or by phone. The more you share about origin, destination, dimensions and timing, the sharper the quote.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></section>
